<title>UK: Hamburgische LB sets 250 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB sets 250 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hamburgische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.0	MATURITY  **22.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE  S-16.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K) 10	  S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO 23.DEC.96 THEN 5.40 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE AT PAR 23.DEC.96</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEFE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
